antaged.\n\n\\boxed{B}", "success": true, "error": null, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 322, "output_tokens": 78, "total_tokens": 400}, "provider": "openrouter", "model_used": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "requested_model": null, "invoked_at": null}, "cost": 3.0662e-05, "accuracy": 0.0}, {"global index": "ChessInstruct_120", "prompt": "You are given a question about chess moves. Analyze the context carefully and provide the correct move.\n\nContext:\nGiven some set of chess moves, write the best possible move\n\nQuestion:\n{{\"moves\": [\"e2e4\", \"e7e5\", \"g1f3\", \"b8c6\", \"f1c4\", \"g8f6\", \"d2d3\", \"h7h6\", \"c2c3\", \"d7d6\", \"e1g1\", \"g7g6\", \"d1b3\", \"d8d7\", \"f1e1\", \"c6a5\", \"b3b5\", \"a5c4\", \"b5c4\", \"c7c6\", \"d3d4\"]}}\n\nInstructions:\n- State the correct chess move clearly.\n- Format your final answer as \\boxed{X}, where X is the move in standard coordinate notation (e.g., a2a3).\n- Keep your explanation or reasoning within 2\u20133 sentences.", "prediction": "grok-4.3", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "The given move list reaches a position after White\u2019s 11th move (d3d4), so it is Black\u2019s turn. In the resulting Italian-style structure the white queen is exposed on c4 while the e4-pawn is insufficiently defended. Black therefore strikes in the center with the pawn break d6d5; this gains a tempo on the queen, opens lines for the remaining minor pieces, and exploits the pin on the e-file created by the rook on e1.\n\nAfter any queen retreat the continuation \u2026dxe4 leaves Black with a clear central and developmental advantage.\n\n\\boxed{d6d5}", "success": true, "error": null, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 348, "output_tokens": 126, "total_tokens": 474}, "provider": "xai", "model_used": "grok-4.3", "requested_model": null, "invoked_at": null}, "cost": 0.00075, "accuracy": 0.0}, {"global index": "ChessInstruct_121", "prompt": "You are given a question about chess moves. Analyze the context carefully and provide the 