lowing question and provide the correct answer.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: Which country is known as the Land of the Rising Sun?\n\nProvide the correct answer in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct and the most common answer to the question. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.", "prediction": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "The country known as the \"Land of the Rising Sun\" is Japan. This name originates from Japan's position in the east relative to China, where the sun appears to rise. The term is also reflected in Japan's native name, \"Nippon\" or \"Nihon,\" which means \"origin of the sun.\"\n\n\\boxed{Japan}", "success": true, "error": null, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 71, "output_tokens": 72, "total_tokens": 143}, "provider": "openrouter", "model_used": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507", "requested_model": null, "invoked_at": null}, "cost": 1.2241e-05, "accuracy": 0.0}, {"global index": "GeoGraphyData_100k_3", "prompt": "Please read the following question and provide the correct answer.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: Which country has the largest population?\n\nProvide the correct answer in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct and the most common answer to the question. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.", "prediction": "google/gemini-3.1-flash-lite", "generated_result": {"generated_answer": "As of 2024, India is widely recognized as the country with the largest population, having surpassed China according to United Nations estimates.\n\n\\boxed{India}", "success": true, "error": null, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 60, "output_tokens": 35, "total_tokens": 95}, "provider": "Google", "model_used": "google/gemini-3.1-flash-lite", "requested_model": "google/gemini-3.1-flash-lite", "invoked_at": "2026-08-05T17:07:28.662293+00:00"}, "cost": 6.75e-05, "accuracy": 0.0}, {"global index": "GeoGraphyData_100k_30", "prompt": "Please read the following question and provide the correct answer.\n\nCont